        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fb" value="&lt;b&gt;Forced Bypass (overlay, any state)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;SET FORCED BYPASS ON → relay Bypass, READY slow-flash AMBER in all states, alarm relay in alarm condition. SET FORCED BYPASS OFF → returns (READY steady green when cooled). (p14, p36, p62)" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="480" width="380" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" value="Notes (Table 9): * Fast Flash = twice per second, Slow Flash = once per second. ** On power up both FAULT and READY momentarily illuminate AMBER during state 0. Exit from state 8 is not stated. Typical cooldown 3-5 h; Normal expected within 5 h (p32). Grey dashed arrows = order of the table only." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
